<title>USA: Astrocom completes private placement.</title>
<headline>Astrocom completes private placement.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Astrocom Corp said Monday it completed a $3.5 million private placement offering.</p>
<p>The company, which provides advanced telecommunications products for wide area networking applications, said it received proceeds of $3,046,000.</p>
<p>The private placement offer units consisted of one share of common stock and one warrant to acquire a share of common stock at an exercise price of $1.50 per share. The price of each unit was $1.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
